{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510178","name":"艾梅莉埃【彩蛋】","desc":"艾梅莉埃彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/21/50494840/dfedb5beb9a8cf0268d60effed726b29_2427891273877414352.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e枫丹香水设计师，将秘密藏于瓶中之人。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/04/50494840/3753712ae6c479c8f1ee841f60b1835f_7496833896831277386.png\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e艾梅莉埃\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e9月22日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e枫丹廷\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/04/50494840/ea778fafcd8b200940005b093188c418_4707874752968556287.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"contents\":{\"4yfpsy82lmuT1772598198323\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：等派蒙睡觉了我喷她头上。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"5qfghvg9hn4T1772597492822\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e派蒙：才没有啦！你仔细闻闻，真的有一股很奇怪的水煮鱼味，但我又说不上哪里怪…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"68updyuc08qT1772598278366\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e派蒙：你…你好恐怖喔！要喷也喷杏仁豆腐味的啦，吃太辣的话会睡不着的…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：咦？怎么又有一股水煮鱼的味道，闻起来烫烫的，不像是刚才的香水…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：派蒙，旅行者，艾梅莉埃小姐，开饭啦！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"6e0v3s9qp3qT1772598314223\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：什、什么时候？！\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e胡桃：哎呀，别管那些了，刚才动脑筋太多，本堂主肚子也要饿扁了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e胡桃：哦对了，香菱啊，你帮我再做一份杏仁豆腐呗，客卿他帮我排队买点心去了，我也给他带一份吃的回去。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e胡桃：香水也借我用用，嘿嘿…喷了水煮鱼味香水的杏仁豆腐，看看客卿吃了之后，会有什么感想。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ar6wrngolwjT1772598196988\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：香菱，把香水借我用用。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"azt82yrv52hT1772597779576\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：果然是艾梅莉埃…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e香菱：旅行者你来得正好，来来来，你也来闻闻我的手腕。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：艾梅莉埃姐姐刚帮我们做了一份水煮鱼味的香水，可好玩了！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"beu2l9sq1mvT1772597832719\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：这、这味道是…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e派蒙：唔…闻着闻着，我真的要闻饿了…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e胡桃：哼哼。你瞧，本堂主说得没错吧。这种香水确实能勾起人的食欲来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e胡桃：香菱啊，你就听我的，就把这种香水喷在你们万民堂的菜谱上。每一道菜，都对应一种香水。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e胡桃：就算是客人没吃过这种菜，只要闻闻菜谱，就知道大概是什么味道了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：对喔，这样就可以避免客人点错了菜又不想吃，既浪费食物，又浪费钱了…！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e胡桃：对啦对啦，以后我们还可以专门做一本厚厚的「璃月菜味道图谱」，只要翻开，就能闻到对应菜的味道，这肯定好玩！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：怎么听起来，像是把一大堆菜塞进一个柜子里一样。这样肯定会串味的啦…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"gzghqqwwpbsT1772597427401\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：派蒙肚子又饿了？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"hlm5f4rez4sT1772597498136\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：咦？那边的人是…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"imykas64nrjT1772597428426\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：我们这就去点一份吧。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"io8vz51i3umT1772597518442\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e胡桃：…真的是水煮鱼味的香水！香菱，你也来闻闻，是不是这个味道？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：嗯…哇！真的，连辣椒的香味都还原了，这到底是怎么做到的…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e艾梅莉埃：一些不同于常理的香料组合，特殊的香料研磨技术…最重要的是，一位专业厨师的协助。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：嘿嘿，毕竟我们店里每天都有好多人吃水煮鱼，我对这种味道可熟悉了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：就算那股水煮鱼的香味不是来自于锅里，而是来自于香水瓶里，我也绝对不会闻错！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"r79nij6xrriT1772597390864\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"xccrgf4lb39T1772597498805\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：我好像知道水煮鱼味从哪里来了…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"zwq8muvt4d8T1772598079559\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：香水…是这么用的吗…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e派蒙：听起来还挺好玩的呀，嘿嘿，翻开来就可以闻见好吃的…不过，这样是不是更容易饿了…？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e艾梅莉埃：食品调香也是一个值得深究的门道。况且随性调配的即兴之作，本就是悦己之物，不必对谁负责，兴致来了，用在哪里都合适。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e艾梅莉埃：况且…呵呵，看来这瓶香水，已经起作用了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：呜哇！刚才不是我肚子叫，是旅行者！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}},\"root_id\":\"r79nij6xrriT1772597390864\",\"child_ids\":{\"r79nij6xrriT1772597390864\":[]}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"contents\":{},\"root_id\":\"eu5pbv1ucwgT1772597390885\",\"child_ids\":{\"eu5pbv1ucwgT1772597390885\":[]}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"4d8wjxys6g4T1772597390911\",\"child_ids\":{\"4d8wjxys6g4T1772597390911\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"yr40oeb5auT1772597390916\",\"child_ids\":{\"yr40oeb5auT1772597390916\":[]},\"contents\":{}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"灵感⋯——2024-09-22\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e想将杂乱思绪清理干净的时候，到野外采风是个不错的选择。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e雨后的草地，被碎浪冲刷的木头，披拂花圃的晚风⋯大自然总有慰悦人心的力量。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e今日傍晚，我途经一处湖中垂柳，风里飘来了湖光铃兰的幽香。静静闻嗅，香气淡雅绵长，仿佛一位长久陪伴在身边，却不轻易叨扰的邻居。顺着这无形的丝线，我想起了更多人和更多事⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我想，我有新的灵感了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e请收下这束花，也请期待我下一款香水作品吧，我很乐意聆听你的使用感受。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"7514\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/11/07/4820086/df51da7b76880f490cf851784bcd69b2_7087988511192205049.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"湖光铃兰\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7514/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7514/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e湖光铃兰\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"501574\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/07/17/24077343/f81eadd30d9940dbad4ec231641b6604_5726030367133089858.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"奶油炖鸡\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/501574/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/501574/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e奶油炖鸡\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/22/50494840/ef364a48ddd0e290657a5b2e8ebe646b_8126462019660537025.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/22/50494840/ef364a48ddd0e290657a5b2e8ebe646b_8126462019660537025.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/57846502\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e艾梅莉埃生日快乐｜这是…为我准备的花束吗——\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"绽放⋯——2025-09-22\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e今日收工时间仅比预期迟了两小时，这已算得上是难得的高效，比平日盈余的时间正好可以用来整理现场清理工作的笔记。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e保密原因，许多细节不便透露，但值得探讨的是，现场某本诗集的书签页上重点标记了这样一句话：「众目所向的蓓蕾才能昂首舒展；无人识的绿意，蜷在种壳里长眠」…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e单从科学性来分析，这个比喻相当荒谬。自然界中没有一朵花会因为欣赏它的人太少而放弃绽放。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e就如随信附上的鲜花，从种子到如今盛放，过程中会经历无数的环境考验。但影响它生长的变量中，从不包括世人的眼光。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"6975\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/08/15/183046623/556c64127ca7ff589cc2552e27a08cae_8214425667987841604.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"柔灯铃\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6975/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6975/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e柔灯铃\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"501574\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/07/17/24077343/f81eadd30d9940dbad4ec231641b6604_5726030367133089858.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"奶油炖鸡\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/501574/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/501574/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e奶油炖鸡\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/22/50494840/7a6fcd7811a38385c1f230a4657693a7_8239089046931779293.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/22/50494840/7a6fcd7811a38385c1f230a4657693a7_8239089046931779293.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/68810416\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e艾梅莉埃生日快乐｜你也来摸摸它吧，相信你也会感到治愈的。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"定香⋯——2026-09-22\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e昨夜调香至中途，被紧急唤去处理另一件「工作」。今晨打开工作室的门时，本以为需要重头来过，不料迎接我的竟是一阵馥郁的芬芳。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久置后的小样竟展现出意料外的层次感。这大概是今天的第一件惊喜？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我原以为生日不过是寻常日子里的一个标记，并无特别之处。可回看这一年，我也想起了一些安静却清晰的片段。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e也许有些意义，正像香气一样，不在初见时张扬，反而在停留之后，才更容易记住。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e随信附上一些小样。愿它在你整理思绪或短暂停步时，带来一丝恰到好处的陪伴。若你有意，也可择日告诉我你的感受。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"7515\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/11/07/4820086/a0b5fea25e1a60a9f775d18b518c5910_8152139118558202465.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"初露之源\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7515/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7515/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e初露之源\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/sp